      "label": "sdc02_0256_sister_07",
      "hash64": "F7D077A5533A5E04",
      "text": "我越聽越覺得，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳經歷太多大冒險了吧？\\r\\n難怪膽子這麼大。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
